gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Hi! Sorry to keep you waiting!\p"
	.string "Welcome to the world of POKéMON!\n"
	.string "Or should I say...\p"
	.string "The world of PINBALL!\p"
	.string "My name is BIRCH.\p"
	.string "But everyone calls me the POKéMON\n"
	.string "PROFESSOR.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This is what we call a “POKéMON.”\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "This world is widely inhabited by\n"
	.string "creatures known as POKéMON.\p"
	.string "But lately, things have gotten\n"
	.string "a little... bouncy.\p"
	.string "A strange machine called the\n"
	.string "TILT-O-TRON has TILTED the whole\l"
	.string "region like a giant pinball table!\p"
	.string "Now wild POKéMON appear totally at\n"
	.string "random. Any species, anywhere!\p"
	.string "Win battles to build a COMBO and\n"
	.string "cash in on big JACKPOTS!\p"
	.string "But watch out. If the ball drains,\n"
	.string "your combo is lost.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "And you are?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you a boy?\n"
	.string "Or are you a girl?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "All right.\n"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "Ah, okay!\p"
	.string "You're {PLAYER}{KUN} who's moving to my\n"
	.string "hometown of LITTLEROOT.\l"
	.string "I get it now!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "All right, are you ready?\p"
	.string "Your very own TILTED adventure is\n"
	.string "about to unfold.\p"
	.string "Take courage, and leap into a world\n"
	.string "where combos, jackpots, and\l"
	.string "friendships await!\p"
	.string "When you get to LITTLEROOT, say hi\n"
	.string "to the PINBALL WIZARD in town.\p"
	.string "Well, I'll be expecting you later.\n"
	.string "Come see me in my POKéMON LAB.\p"
	.string "$"
